{"abstract":[{"text":"Preload plans in advance and reuse them without the internet during an app lifecycle.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/Preload-Plan","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Preloaded plans act as singletons, meaning that each preloaded plan keeps its state across all app screens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example: if a user selects a booth in a preloaded plan, then closes a screen and opens another one with the same preloaded plan, they will see the booth they selected on the open screen."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To preload plans you need to use "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"ExpoFpPlan.preloader","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get a preloaded "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presenter"},{"type":"text","text":" and show plans you need an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/ExpoFpPreloadedPlanInfo"}]}]}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a plan is reloaded with a new "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/IExpoFpPlanPresenter\/planLink","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the link info will be automatically updated in the corresponding "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.expofp.sdk\/documentation\/ExpoFP\/ExpoFpPreloadedPlanInfo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Preload from the internet","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Prel